name twic
# The Week in Chess (theweekinchess.com): a weekly issue of the over-the-board games of that week's events, one PGN file
# an issue (twicNNNN.pgn, opened from twicNNNN.zip beside it; Laplace-Operations data.tsv). A corpus witnessing its
# records, as chess-com's archive is: White and Black are participants named in each record, never witnesses.
witness The Week in Chess
class StructuredCorpus
root $LAPLACE_DATA/Games/Chess/twic
files $LAPLACE_DATA/Games/Chess/twic/*.pgn
after unicode
